    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 21 Station Court View, Coolmine, Dublin 15, to the market. This superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom own-door ground-floor apartment is ideally positioned in a highly sought-after location and offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike.\nThe property enjoys an excellent location, with Coolmine Train Station just a few minutes' walk away, providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. There is also easy access to the M50, N3 and N4 motorway networks, while Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is just minutes away. A host of schools, shops and local amenities are also within easy reach.\nBright and well-proportioned internal accommodation extending to approximately c. 61 sq.m comprises an own-door entrance, living/dining area, kitchen, two bedrooms and two bathrooms. The property also enjoys an attractive outlook towards a south-facing green area to the front and a generous sunny rear garden.\nThe apartment benefits from a B3 BER rating, which qualifies for a green mortgage, and is heated by gas-fired central heating. The property is offered to the market with no onward chain and has a management fee of approximately 1,300 per annum.\nNo. 21 Station Court View represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-located own-door apartment in a mature and convenient Dublin 15 location. With Coolmine Train Station on the doorstep, excellent transport links and Blanchardstown Shopping Centre close by, this property is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers.\nEarly viewing is strongly advised.\n\nFeatures:\n• 2 Bed / 2 Bath Own-Door Apartment\n• Ground Floor\n• C. 61 sq.m\n• BER B3 Rated\n• Qualifies for Green Mortgage\n• No onward chain\n• Management Fee c. 1,300 p.a.\n• Gas-fired central heating\n• South-facing green area to front and generous rear garden\n• Excellent location\n• Coolmine Train Station just a few minutes' walk\n• Easy access to M50, N3 & N4\n• Blanchardstown Shopping Centre just minutes away\n• Close to schools, shops & local amenities\n• Ideal first-time buyer / downsizer / investment opportunity\n• Early viewing strongly advised"
      },
      {
